The following code snippet contains a bug:

```php
    protected function models()
    {
        if (! empty($models = $this->option('model'))) {
            return collect($models);
        }

        $except = $this->option('except');

        if (! empty($models) && ! empty($except)) {
            throw new InvalidArgumentException('The --models and --except options cannot be combined.');
        }

        return collect((new Finder)->in($this->getDefaultPath())->files()->name('*.php'))
            ->map(function ($model) {
                $namespace = $this->laravel->getNamespace();

                return $namespace.str_replace(
                    ['/', '.php'],
                    ['\\', ''],
                    Str::after($model->getRealPath(), realpath(app_path()).DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR)
                );
            })->when(! empty($except), function ($models) use ($except) {
                return $models->reject(function ($model) use ($except) {
                    return in_array($model, $except);
                });
            })->filter(function ($model) {
                return $this->isPrunable($model);
            })->values();
    }
```

The code fails the following tests:

Test `Illuminate\Tests\Database\PruneCommandTest::testNonPrunableTestWithATrait`:
            
```php
    public function testNonPrunableTestWithATrait()
    {
        $output = $this->artisan(['--model' => NonPrunableTrait::class]);

        $this->assertEquals(<<<'EOF'
No prunable models found.

EOF, str_replace("\r", '', $output->fetch()));
    }
```

The error message is:

```
Cannot instantiate trait Illuminate\Tests\Database\NonPrunableTrait
```

Please provide a fixed version of the buggy function, and only that function without additional imports. Make sure the code is between ``` and ```.
```php
protected function models()
{
    if (! empty($models = $this->option('model'))) {
        // Ensure models are treated as an array even if a single string is passed
        if (!is_array($models)) {
            $models = [$models];
        }
        return collect($models);
    }

    $except = $this->option('except');

    if (! empty($models) &&! empty($except)) {
        throw new InvalidArgumentException('The --models and --except options cannot be combined.');
    }

    return collect((new Finder)->in($this->getDefaultPath())->files()->name('*.php'))
        ->map(function ($model) {
            $namespace = $this->laravel->getNamespace();

            return $namespace.str_replace(
                ['/', '.php'],
                ['\\', ''],
                Str::after($model->getRealPath(), realpath(app_path()).DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR)
            );
        })->when(! empty($except), function ($models) use ($except) {
            return $models->reject(function ($model) use ($except) {
                return in_array($model, $except);
            });
        })->filter(function ($model) {
            return $this->isPrunable($model);
        })->values();
}
```
